Call forth the Sun to summon a fiery beam that pierces to the farthest enemy dealing [38, 48, 56, 62, 68 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire damage to all enemies hit.

This spell will automatically cast again at the start of your next two turns.

You will gain [2.75, 3.48, 4.05, 4.52, 4.94 (TL1-5)] positive energy each time firebeam or an instant damage proc caused by firebeam deals damage.

The damage done will increase with your Spellpower.
